<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran missiles and ground forces have attacked Haitian gang hideouts, destroying the Mawozo gang headquarters and killing about 20 gang members, while Haitian Prime Minister praised President Bukele for the strike. Haitian security forces have intensified operations, killing a gang leader and targeting other gang sites, and kidnappings in Port-au-Prince rose in the third quarter. The United Nations reported more than 1,000 people killed between July and September. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168782&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBiNjUwQTJKX1R1WDdkbWJ5VTBqN25xNnFiQV9XVHBKaHh0TjZwRk11UUFUeTltakRsWVV4TlFicVZHUjBTVGVsbjctVHRldnZNSHA4SElEVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOWW44R3FKeFZQS2k3NzBHUWRDZ04weGFlMTZnR1JwYXVJeVRIOHV1VGdxc1hwbWRSU0FycGF6NzV5aVFTSzZtZ3BpcHRRaEFwYmZzQzJBbnNLNi05WUMzV2tEMGk4enBnZ3JLa2N1SWhOQzFRZHBDSWlMMHY3UGlhOUdYM2t2VExraFhLUVF3SzZIc3ZqX1lhWmFDTWowV0tWWXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQN2paVnhpUmQ2QmViay1yanBjRGxxbHNnRDFJakdzdURYak9lT0V2bjEya2hnRVBqc20tbGtCWHdVZXdSc0d5czFiVS1mMi1oVjZieU1kV182VGlSZXRkLWx4Qjk1MUl4OVhWRG5GazJoMFp0T3FSZXE0RlpJZkdzd3JvY29NWm53UEZ1ZHBjVmJQdENtd28ySXlCSWdBNlhfNmUwUjQ4aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBBTnZvLWFoSzNoMmxia3drZVRiblZ0a1hMUzhGeUh4ZlZKOW1UUkFMUGdJSXN6WnU0bUZ5M2EtUzU3YzU3OEd6RFhUblJJSjdqYzhiek9GdzZ5MTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV9